      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caledonia%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Caledonia Bowstring Bridge, a historic iron structure, sits on the village’s northern edge and is listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
