      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caledonia%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Caledonia is one of Ohio’s rare post‑glaciation prairie preserves, a grassland that stretches along the Whetstone River in the Sandusky Plains.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
